# Agent Routing And Governance Map

## Purpose

This guide keeps agent context small, predictable, and verifiable.

Use this map before spec, planning, implementation, and review work.

## Global Base Read Set

Always read this base set first:

1. `docs/README.md`
2. `docs/research/engineering-principles.md`
3. The most relevant file under `docs/specs`
4. The relevant file under `docs/status` when available

For frontend or interaction scope, always add:

1. `docs/research/hci-principles.md`

Before marking local implementation work complete, run `./scripts/validate-changed-scope.mjs`. Use `./scripts/finalize.sh` for CI, pre-merge, or explicit full finalization.

